   "dur": 10.4334
  },
  {
   "id": "r2",
   "text": "Dua, Karpathy Skills. Cuma satu file CLAUDE.md isinya empat aturan. Mikir dulu, bikin sesimpel mungkin, ubah seperlunya, dan buktikan jalan.",
   "w0": 33,
   "w1": 52,
   "speech": [
